{
  "map": "UndeadRE01",
  "title": "Silverpine Sprint",
  "locale": "itIT",
  "note": "Blizzard's order from conversation.json (trigger groups as listed, lines by conversationOrder).",
  "lines": [
    {
      "speaker": "Glix",
      "text": "Va bene, Garek. Sarai da solo sul percorso a cercare di battere il tempo degli altri piloti.",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 2608,
        "speaker_string_id": 2829,
        "dialogue_id": "A1M4-T010-GLIX"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Glix",
      "text": "Ascolta le mie istruzioni, tieni gli occhi sulla strada e portiamo a casa il risultato!",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 2609,
        "speaker_string_id": 2830,
        "dialogue_id": "A1M4-T020-GLIX"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Glix",
      "text": "Piano sull'acceleratore...",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 2430,
        "speaker_string_id": 2833,
        "dialogue_id": "A1M4-T030-GLIX"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Glix",
      "text": "Ho detto di andare piano!",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 2618,
        "speaker_string_id": 2831,
        "dialogue_id": "A1M4-T040-GLIX"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Glix",
      "text": "Pronti... Partenza... VIA!",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 2613,
        "speaker_string_id": 2832,
        "dialogue_id": "A1M4-T050-GLIX"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Glix",
      "text": "Garek, stai distruggendo il veicolo!",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 2510,
        "speaker_string_id": 2815,
        "dialogue_id": "A1M4-T060-GLIX"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Glix",
      "text": "Devi restare sul percorso!",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 2497,
        "speaker_string_id": 2816,
        "dialogue_id": "A1M4-T070-GLIX"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Glix",
      "text": "Tripla attenzione! Tripla attenzione!",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 2588,
        "speaker_string_id": 2817,
        "dialogue_id": "A1M4-T080-GLIX"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Glix",
      "text": "Concentrati, Garek! Ti prego!",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 2585,
        "speaker_string_id": 2818,
        "dialogue_id": "A1M4-T090-GLIX"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Glix",
      "text": "Garek! Ascolta le mie istruzioni!",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 2584,
        "speaker_string_id": 2819,
        "dialogue_id": "A1M4-T100-GLIX"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Glix",
      "text": "Garek, Garek, che stai facendo?!?",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 2583,
        "speaker_string_id": 2820,
        "dialogue_id": "A1M4-T110-GLIX"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Glix",
      "text": "Murloc! Attenzione!",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 2582,
        "speaker_string_id": 2821,
        "dialogue_id": "A1M4-T120-GLIX"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Glix",
      "text": "Abominio sulla strada!",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 2835,
        "speaker_string_id": 2834,
        "dialogue_id": "A1M4-T130-GLIX"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Glix",
      "text": "Destra, destra!",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 2581,
        "speaker_string_id": 2822,
        "dialogue_id": "A1M4-T140-GLIX"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Glix",
      "text": "Curva a destra avanti!",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 2580,
        "speaker_string_id": 2823,
        "dialogue_id": "A1M4-T150-GLIX"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Glix",
      "text": "Gira a destra, Garek!",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 2579,
        "speaker_string_id": 2824,
        "dialogue_id": "A1M4-T160-GLIX"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Glix",
      "text": "Sinistra, sinistra!",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 2578,
        "speaker_string_id": 2825,
        "dialogue_id": "A1M4-T170-GLIX"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Glix",
      "text": "Curva a sinistra in arrivo!",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 2577,
        "speaker_string_id": 2826,
        "dialogue_id": "A1M4-T180-GLIX"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Glix",
      "text": "A sinistra, Garek!",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 2576,
        "speaker_string_id": 2827,
        "dialogue_id": "A1M4-T190-GLIX"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Glix",
      "text": "Siamo quasi arrivati! Verso il traguardo, Garek!",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 2605,
        "speaker_string_id": 2828,
        "dialogue_id": "A1M4-T200-GLIX"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Glix",
      "text": "Abbiamo vinto?!? Abbiamo vinto! Non ne ho dubitato nemmeno per un secondo!",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 2836,
        "speaker_string_id": 2837,
        "dialogue_id": "A1M4-T210-GLIX"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Glix",
      "text": "Non male per un principiante, immagino.",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 2838,
        "speaker_string_id": 2839,
        "dialogue_id": "A1M4-T220-GLIX"
      }
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Glix",
      "text": "Be'... Purché sia una gara da cui riesci ad andartene con le tue gambe, no?",
      "metadata": {
        "string_id": 2840,
        "speaker_string_id": 2841,
        "dialogue_id": "A1M4-T230-GLIX"
      }
    }
  ]
}